  "description": "Interactive message-broker console for the Scalar API Reference in ASP.NET Core. Serves a Scalar bundle that publishes to and tails your Kafka/MQTT/AMQP channels through an opt-in server-side bridge, driven by your AsyncAPI bindings. Install a driver package (for example Bielu.AspNetCore.AsyncApi.Scalar.Broker.Kafka) to connect to a broker.",
